{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"第四章：异步系统工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backpressure-flow-control","title":"背压与流量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/backpressure-flow-control","wordCount":703,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"message-schema-evolution","title":"消息 Schema 演进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/message-schema-evolution","wordCount":767,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-observability","title":"异步系统可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/async-observability","wordCount":685,"readingTime":3}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第四章-异步系统工程实践\">第四章：异步系统工程实践</h1><p>本章聚焦异步消息系统的三个横切工程问题：背压与流量控制、消息 Schema 演进和异步系统可观测性。这三个主题不属于某个具体消息系统，而是所有消息驱动架构都必须解决的通用挑战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心主题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"backpressure-flow-control\">背压与流量控制</a></td>\n<td>消费者速率控制、背压传播、流量整形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"message-schema-evolution\">消息 Schema 演进</a></td>\n<td>Schema 兼容性策略、Avro/Protobuf、Schema Registry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"async-observability\">异步系统可观测性</a></td>\n<td>分布式追踪、消息链路关联、Lag 监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键原则\">关键原则</h2><p>异步系统相较同步系统的核心挑战是<strong>可见性缺失</strong>——生产者不知道消息是否被及时处理，消费者不知道消息从哪里来。本章的三个主题都是围绕「恢复可见性」展开的工程实践。</p>\n"}